<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Sign in — mockup</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bungee&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #0b0a14; --bg-mid: #171129; --bg-deep2: #241a3d;
    --ink: #f4f1fb; --ink-dim: #a89fc9;
    --red: #ff4d5e; --orange: #ff9838; --yellow: #ffd54a;
    --green: #35d68f; --blue: #3fa8ff; --purple: #b874ff;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.6; min-height: 100vh; }
  .display { font-family: 'Bungee', cursive; letter-spacing: 0.01em; }

  .stripe-bar { height: 5px; display: flex; }
  .stripe-bar span { flex: 1; }
  .stripe-bar .s1 { background: var(--red); } .stripe-bar .s2 { background: var(--orange); }
  .stripe-bar .s3 { background: var(--yellow); } .stripe-bar .s4 { background: var(--green); }
  .stripe-bar .s5 { background: var(--blue); } .stripe-bar .s6 { background: var(--purple); }

  nav { background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.12); }
  .nav-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 18px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }
  .wordmark { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; line-height: 1.2; }
  .wordmark small { display: block; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--ink-dim); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.06em; margin-top: 3px; }
  .nav-links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; list-style: none; }
  .nav-links a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; padding-bottom: 4px; }
  .nav-links a.active { border-color: var(--purple); color: var(--purple); }
  .nav-links .disabled { opacity: 0.75; }
  .badge-soon { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--bg); background: var(--ink-dim); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px; margin-left: 6px; vertical-align: middle; }

  .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 70px 24px; }
  .signin-card { width: 100%; max-width: 400px; background: var(--bg-mid); border: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.1); border-radius: 14px; padding: 36px 32px; }
  .signin-card h1 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .signin-card > p.sub { color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.88rem; margin-bottom: 26px; }

  .btn-google {
    width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px;
    background: #fff; color: #1a1a1a; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem;
    padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn-google svg { width: 18px; height: 18px; }

  .divider { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 22px 0; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
  .divider::before, .divider::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: rgba(244,241,251,0.14); }

  .field label { display: block; font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink-dim); margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .field input { width: 100%; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; padding: 11px 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(244,241,251,0.16); border-radius: 8px; background: rgba(11,10,20,0.6); color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .field input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 1px; border-color: transparent; }

  .btn-email {
    width: 100%; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #1a0a0a;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--orange), var(--red)); padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .fine-print { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--ink-dim); text-align: center; }
  .back-link { display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 22px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-dim); text-decoration: none; }
  .back-link:hover { color: var(--purple); }

  footer { background: var(--bg); padding: 28px 24px; text-align: center; color: var(--ink-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 40px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#" class="wordmark display">SF LGBT BOWLERS
      <small>WEDNESDAY COMMUNITY BOWLING</small>
    </a>
    <ul class="nav-links">
      <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
      <li><a href="#">Leagues</a></li>
      <li><a href="#" class="disabled">Tournaments<span class="badge-soon">Coming soon</span></a></li>
      <li><a href="#" class="active">Member Login</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</nav>
<div class="stripe-bar"><span class="s1"></span><span class="s2"></span><span class="s3"></span><span class="s4"></span><span class="s5"></span><span class="s6"></span></div>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="signin-card">
    <h1 class="display">Sign in</h1>
    <p class="sub">Sign in to manage your league or access member tools.</p>

    <button class="btn-google">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48"><path fill="#FFC107" d="M43.6 20.5H42V20H24v8h11.3c-1.6 4.6-6 8-11.3 8-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12s5.4-12 12-12c3.1 0 5.8 1.1 8 3l5.7-5.7C34.5 6.1 29.5 4 24 4 12.9 4 4 12.9 4 24s8.9 20 20 20 20-8.9 20-20c0-1.3-.1-2.7-.4-3.5z"/><path fill="#FF3D00" d="M6.3 14.7l6.6 4.8C14.6 15.9 18.9 13 24 13c3.1 0 5.8 1.1 8 3l5.7-5.7C34.5 6.1 29.5 4 24 4 16.3 4 9.6 8.3 6.3 14.7z"/><path fill="#4CAF50" d="M24 44c5.3 0 10.2-2 13.9-5.4l-6.4-5.4C29.4 34.9 26.8 36 24 36c-5.2 0-9.7-3.4-11.3-8l-6.6 5.1C9.5 39.6 16.2 44 24 44z"/><path fill="#1976D2" d="M43.6 20.5H42V20H24v8h11.3c-.8 2.3-2.2 4.2-4 5.6l6.4 5.4C41.5 36 44 30.5 44 24c0-1.3-.1-2.7-.4-3.5z"/></svg>
      Continue with Google
    </button>

    <div class="divider">or</div>

    <div class="field">
      <label for="email">Email address</label>
      <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
    </div>
    <button class="btn-email">Send me a sign-in link</button>

    <p class="fine-print">We'll email you a secure link — no password needed. Works with any email provider.</p>
    <a href="#" class="back-link">&larr; Back to sflgbtbowl.com</a>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>SF LGBT Bowlers</footer>
</body>
</html>